      "stepId": "scene_07_003",
      "audioFile": "scene_07_003.wav",
      "subtitle": "Sharp! a to the negative n equals ONE divided by a to the n. It's the RECIPROCAL. Two to the negative three equals one over two to the three, which is one over eight.",
